{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"items\":[{\"id\":\"S01-r2-i1\",\"text\":\"开头两下高低音齐鸣，像夏夜威尼斯上空升起的烟花，光点落下后仍悬在水面上方\"},{\"id\":\"S02-r2-i2\",\"text\":\"右手两串高低音贴得很近，像肩膀挨肩膀，呼吸、体温也融在一处，也像夏末潮湿温热的风裹在皮肤上\"},{\"id\":\"S04-r2-i1\",\"text\":\"熟悉的歌声又回来，两串音仍贴耳低语，这遍却更华丽、更迫切，高音绕弯像水面晃眼的光斑\"},{\"id\":\"S04-r4-i3\",\"text\":\"两串音仍贴得那么近，左手水波却一直向前，仿佛每一秒都在倒数；还没有失去什么，就已经舍不得\"},{\"id\":\"S06-r4-i1\",\"text\":\"那串音低声下来，另一串不时回应、插话，又纠缠回来，像一个念头刚安静下去又浮上来\"},{\"id\":\"S09-r2-i1\",\"text\":\"前面那股几乎冲出的势头突然收住；飘渺颤音和轻柔叠起的高低音悬在半空，像对视时呼吸停了\"},{\"id\":\"S12-r2-i1\",\"text\":\"那支温柔晴朗的歌在这里铺得更开阔，中间几层音彼此拉扯，一浪高过一浪；像整个人被卷进比自己更大的世界，连「我」都退到后面\"},{\"id\":\"S14-r2-i2\",\"text\":\"左手中间音幽幽唱句，像男中音独自沉思；接着，右手一串细碎音像水花溅落夜空\"},{\"id\":\"S14-r4-i1\",\"text\":\"尾声像远远回应开头；最后几下高低音齐齐向上抬起，像接住开头悬着的话，终于把它说完\"},{\"id\":\"S14-r4-i2\",\"text\":\"最后几下高低音齐响，干脆沉重，低音像铁锚落入水底，把摇荡的小船定住；也像震荡后站起来，理好衣服，关门\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "08dea888-3182-4d70-9cd5-9d979b73c57f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261109T012951482150Z", "elapsed_seconds": 285.203, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T01:34:36.704460+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "09429527a02fcd40f56d5769bd92f42cadd2143bcdfab29f4a13b43a31f32324", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261109T012951482150Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "01939a1c962ed752b837b2873577e04b1b6945f66564bfa1cfe745ee8eacbea2"}}}
